WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.000
FreeScript. Your story. Your page. Free screenwriting for Mac.

00:03.000 --> 00:08.000
Write your screenplay. A simple writing room for scene headings, action and dialogue.

00:08.000 --> 00:13.000
Let the formatting follow. Enter moves to the next element. Tab changes its type.

00:13.000 --> 00:17.000
Stay in the scene. Focus mode clears the writing room.

00:17.000 --> 00:22.000
Bring a PDF back to the page. Import selectable PDF text and continue editing. Scans need OCR first.

00:22.000 --> 00:27.000
Send the draft on its way. Export PDF, Fountain or a complete FreeScript backup.

00:27.000 --> 00:31.100
Your story. Your page. Download FreeScript on GitHub. Separate ChatGPT and Claude companion available.
